{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"正在面对\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S12-1\",\n      \"text\": \"他没再等一个不伤到任何东西的办法，久违的劲头又回来了。\",\n      \"key\": \"久违的劲头\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S12-2\",\n      \"text\": \"他还是会尽力做事，不再逼自己每一步都得把局面扳回来。\",\n      \"key\": \"扳回局面\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S12-3\",\n      \"text\": \"他舍不得那种不用时时防备的生活，想护住它又怕争取会伤到它。\",\n      \"key\": \"想护住它\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S12-4\",\n      \"text\": \"这份担心让他一度又想退回去，可他没等心里完全踏实，还是接着把该做的事做下去。\",\n      \"key\": \"没等心里完全踏实\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\", \"B3\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-5\",\n      \"to\": \"S12-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-6\",\n      \"to\": \"S12-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S12-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"限制\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S12-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-6\",\n      \"to\": \"S12-4\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S02-1\",\n      \"to\": \"S12-4\",\n      \"rel\": \"改写\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S05-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S12-4\",\n      \"rel\": \"改写\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R60\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S12-1\"],\n      \"what\": \"保留原意，校正前因\",\n      \"why\": \"保留不再等待无损办法、久违劲头回来的主体验。将前因改接S11-5和S11-6，分别说明他为何不能再拖延，以及为何在心里未安稳时仍能重新振作；S02-1只解释不必等想透，不再用它解释放弃无损办法。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R62\", \"R63\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S12-3\"],\n      \"what\": \"具体化并删去重复动作\",\n      \"why\": \"保留他舍不得的生活、想护住它又怕争取伤到它的冲突。删去原句末尾接下眼前该做之事的内容，因为S11-6已经写过承担眼前的事，避免相邻段落重复交代同一行动。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R64\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S12-4\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写并补足段内变化\",\n      \"why\": \"删去重述S07-3的硬撑过头、只剩蛮劲等旧因，集中写担心引起的一瞬退意，以及没等心里完全踏实便继续做事。这样补足B3的短暂动摇与继续向前，也找回不必等犹疑消失才允许自己坚定的心理内容。将S02-1的跨段关系接到此条，因为它改写的是不必等心里全明白才行动，而不是不再等待无损办法。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "5547b120-0b7c-4283-a7b7-f93355774847", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T173340583306Z", "elapsed_seconds": 593.062, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T17:43:33.649691+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "ca416674f349f338d5d4fd2ca301fad02a64baabad4fa4bc5c4c2f1512a7acc1", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridg